WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.180
I hold a story about craft, not an invitation to drink.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:11.137
Timișoara’s brewery was founded in 1718, and Timișoreana was first produced here.

00:00:11.407 --> 00:00:19.348
My bubbles recall an industrial tradition of Fabric, a neighbourhood whose name itself speaks of making things.
